<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reservations board — atablefor (Lisbon restaurants demo)</title>
  <link rel="kiosk" href="https://kiosk.tech/skill.md">
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#8a3b1c;--accent2:#ffcf9b;--ink:#2a1a12;--muted:#98847a;--soft:#f7e6da;--line:#eccbb2;--bg:#faf6f2;--ok:#1a6b3c}
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.5}
    a{color:var(--accent)}
    header{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:0 32px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px}
    .logo span{color:var(--accent2)}
    header nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:13px}
    header nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;opacity:.92}
    header nav a:hover{opacity:1;text-decoration:underline}
    .staff-login{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 13px}
    .signout-btn{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border:0;color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 13px;cursor:pointer}
    .signout-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.28)}
    .whoami{font-size:12px;opacity:.85}
    .wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
    .page-head{margin:30px auto 6px}
    .page-head h1{font-size:24px;font-weight:800}
    .page-head p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
    .page-head p a{font-weight:700}
    .sec{margin:22px auto 0}

    .board{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 22px}
    .board-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .board-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:800}
    .board-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
    .board-count{flex:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ok);background:#e7f5ec;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;white-space:nowrap}
    .board-empty{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 0}
    .res-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .res{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 13px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px}
    .res-party{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:14px;min-width:78px}
    .res-table{font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
    .res-when{font-size:13.5px;color:#5a4638}
    .res-name{margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
    .res-dep{flex:none;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#7a5a12;background:#fbefd2;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 9px}
    .board-note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:13px;line-height:1.45}
    footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding:30px 0 40px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">atable<span>for</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <% if user_signed_in? %>
        <span class="whoami">Staff: <%= current_user.display_name.presence || current_user.email %></span>
        <%= button_to "Sign out", destroy_user_session_path, method: :delete, class: "signout-btn" %>
      <% else %>
        <a class="staff-login" href="/users/sign_in">Staff login</a>
      <% end %>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>Reservations board</h1>
      <p>A public, read-only mirror of upcoming bookings across the atablefor restaurants (Lisbon). Assistants book over the Kiosk wire from the <a href="/">endpoint home</a>; confirmed reservations appear here under each diner's name.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="sec">
      <%= render "board" %>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer>atablefor — demo provider — powered by <a href="https://kiosk.tech">Kiosk</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
